Extension: {{ names.date_labels_extension }}
Id: {{ names.date_labels_extension_id }}
Title: "DHIS2 date labels"
Description: "The words a DHIS2 instance puts on the dates a form captures: the date the enrollment began, the date of the incident it follows, and the date the event happened. A slice is present only where the instance states a label, so a form the instance labels nothing on carries no extension at all, and a capture client then falls back to its own wording."
* ^status = #{{ ig_status }}
* ^experimental = {{ "true" if experimental else "false" }}
* ^context[+].type = #element
* ^context[=].expression = "Questionnaire"
* extension contains
    {{ enrollment_date_sub_extension }} 0..1 and
    {{ incident_date_sub_extension }} 0..1 and
    {{ event_date_sub_extension }} 0..1
* extension[{{ enrollment_date_sub_extension }}] ^short = "What this instance calls the date a tracker enrollment began."
* extension[{{ enrollment_date_sub_extension }}].value[x] only string
* extension[{{ enrollment_date_sub_extension }}].valueString 1..1
* extension[{{ incident_date_sub_extension }}] ^short = "What this instance calls the date of the incident a tracker enrollment follows."
* extension[{{ incident_date_sub_extension }}].value[x] only string
* extension[{{ incident_date_sub_extension }}].valueString 1..1
* extension[{{ event_date_sub_extension }}] ^short = "What this instance calls the date an event was captured on."
* extension[{{ event_date_sub_extension }}].value[x] only string
* extension[{{ event_date_sub_extension }}].valueString 1..1
